# ChatGPT-generated cognitive revision. Reuses generic recollection and appraisal.
# The evidence must be recalled by Soar; no host history counter can activate it.
sp {learned*xing*reinterpret-compatible-request
 (state <s> ^context <c>)
 (<c> ^frame <f> ^evaluated yes ^goal-threat no ^recollection <e>)
 (<f> ^mode response ^self <me> ^request quiet)
 (<e> ^kind distraction ^actor <me> ^source self ^uid <uid>)
 -->
 (<c> ^reframed yes ^concern mutual-space ^interpretation <i>)
 (<i> ^predicate shared-impact ^evidence <uid> ^conclusion preserve-both-activities)
}
sp {learned*xing*protect-concentration-after-experience
 (state <s> ^context <c>)
 (<c> ^frame <f> ^memory-ready yes ^recollection <e>)
 (<f> ^mode act ^self <me> ^active-task study ^hear-tv yes ^noise-minutes > 3 ^manual no ^available <a>)
 (<e> ^kind distraction ^actor <me> ^source self)
 (<a> ^kind askQuiet)
 --> (<s> ^operator <o> +)
 (<o> ^name choose ^choice <a> ^priority 84 ^rule learned*xing*protect-concentration-after-experience ^reason |上次我也被吵得写不下去，这次先商量一下。|)
